namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamTextPaintLibrary {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Text/DreamTextPaintLibrary.h#DreamTextPaintLibrary
    src   "Tweens that move a text's paints (FDreamTextPaint) without repainting it: each drives one of UDreamText's paint\nanimation setters, which write one pixel of the text's paint table a step -- no repaint, no layout. They pause with\nthe game and follow its time dilation as the text's other tweens do (UDreamVisual::ColorTo), and end with the text."
    text  "在不重绘文本的情况下移动其画笔（FDreamTextPaint）的补间：每个补间驱动UDreamText的一个画笔\n动画设置器，每步写入文本画笔表中的一个像素——不重绘，也不重新布局。它们随游戏暂停，并像文本的其他补间\n（UDreamVisual::ColorTo）一样跟随其时间膨胀，且在文本结束时结束。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextPaintLibrary:PaintAngleTo {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Text/DreamTextPaintLibrary.h#DreamTextPaintLibrary:PaintAngleTo
    src   "Turn every paint of the text (UDreamText::SetPaintAngleOffset) from its angle offset now to To, in degrees."
    text  "将文本的每个画笔（UDreamText::SetPaintAngleOffset）的角度偏移从当前值渐变到To，单位为度。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextPaintLibrary:PaintPhaseTo {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Text/DreamTextPaintLibrary.h#DreamTextPaintLibrary:PaintPhaseTo
    src   "Move one paint's phase (UDreamText::SetFacePaintPhase and its siblings) from where it is to To: its gradient slides\nalong its line, 1 being one whole gradient. Null when there is no text, or no tween manager to run it."
    text  "将一个画笔的相位（UDreamText::SetFacePaintPhase及其同类函数）从当前位置移动到To：其渐变沿其线路滑动，\n1表示一整个渐变。没有文本，或没有可运行它的补间管理器时为null。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextPaintLibrary:PlayShimmer {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Text/DreamTextPaintLibrary.h#DreamTextPaintLibrary:PlayShimmer
    src   "Sweep the overlay paint across the text: its phase from -1 to 1 at an even speed, Duration seconds a pass, starting\nagain at -1 after each, Loops passes (-1: until stopped, or until the text goes). The look is the overlay's: a band\nthat is transparent at both ends -- linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 40%, white 50%, transparent 60%) -- with\nOverlayBlend Add, is a shimmer. The phase stays at -1 during the delay, which keeps such a band off the text."
    text  "以匀速让叠加画笔扫过文本：其相位从-1到1，Duration秒一遍，每遍后重新从-1开始，共Loops遍（-1：\n直到停止，或直到文本消失）。外观取决于叠加画笔：一条两端透明的色带\n——linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 40%, white 50%, transparent 60%)——配合\nOverlayBlend的Add，即为微光。延迟期间相位保持为-1，这使这样的色带不会落在文本上。"
    state machine
}

EDreamTextPaintLayer {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Text/DreamTextPaintLibrary.h#EDreamTextPaintLayer
    src   "One of a text's three paints (FDreamTextStyle::FacePaint, OutlinePaint, OverlayPaint), as a tween names it."
    text  "文本三个画笔之一（FDreamTextStyle::FacePaint、OutlinePaint、OverlayPaint），即补间所命名的那个画笔。"
    state machine
}
